  "qualifications": [
    "Rust MessageId tokio::join waits for latest and quorum; Zig detached latest can finish after metadata and owns a global-stop-token Source fork. This differs in critical-path latency, and whole-agent benchmark CPU/RPC must include retained latest work and drain.",
    "Latest-only queue, allocation, fork and storage failures cannot veto an exact valid quorum. Owner cancellation and stopped-executor control still propagate.",
